       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-22 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Bombay High Court Criticizes Authorities Over Mumbai Smog</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Bombay High Court has reprimanded civic and pollution authorities, stating Mumbai’s air quality is now surpassing Delhi’s. Justices GS Kulkarni and Dr. Neela Gokhale expressed shock at deteriorating conditions, noting visibility dropped below 500 meters and morning walks have become impossible for residents.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-22/bombay-high-court-criticizes-authorities-over-mumbai-smog.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The court criticized the BMC and MPCB for failing to issue public warnings against firecracker use or enforce noise limits. Police have been ordered to create a standard operating procedure for violations, as judges warned that official machinery is moving too slowly to address this public health emergency. The court mandated the police commissioner file an affidavit confirming strict implementation of pollution control orders.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately reflects the court's reprimand and the specific directives given to the authorities.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/law-news/story/bombay-high-court-mumbai-smog-surpasses-delhi-air-emergency-pollution-firecrackers-raps-bmc-3022457-2026-10-22?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/mumbai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mumbai</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
