       <h1>Delhi Police Summon CJP Leaders Following Protest Investigation</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Delhi Police Crime Branch has summoned CJP leaders Saurabh Das, Ashutosh Ranka, and Ajinkya Shinde for questioning. The individuals, who were previously released on bail, are being investigated for their alleged roles in protest-related activities and broader concerns regarding the maintenance of law and order.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-22/delhi-police-summon-cjp-leaders-following-protest-investigat.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This inquiry follows ongoing tensions and highlights the continued scrutiny of those involved in recent demonstrations. The summons marks a significant development in the active investigation into the circumstances surrounding these protests, as authorities seek further information from the named leaders.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately summarizes the provided information regarding the police summons without adding extraneous details.</p>
