     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-22 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Four Arrested in Bengaluru for Illegal SIM Box Network</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Karnataka Cyber Command Unit police arrested four individuals for operating an illegal SIM box network across two Bengaluru apartments. Authorities recovered 10 devices with a total capacity of 320 SIM connections, which are suspected of facilitating digital arrest scams, sextortion, and financial cyberfrauds.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-22/four-arrested-in-bengaluru-for-illegal-sim-box-network.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The investigation, launched following a complaint from Bharti Airtel, tracked the supply chain to Tiroda, Maharashtra, where SIM cards were converted into e-SIM profiles. Officials believe the illicit network could be linked to financial losses in the hundreds of crores. Further investigations are ongoing to determine the full extent of the scheme and identify additional participants.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Clean, highly accurate summary of the Bengaluru SIM box arrests and details.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/bangalore/four-arrested-over-illegal-sim-box-network-suspected-of-aiding-cyberfrauds/article71612467.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/bengaluru/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bengaluru</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-22/four-arrested-in-bengaluru-for-illegal-sim-box-network" data-title="Four Arrested in Bengaluru for Illegal SIM Box Network"><b>Share:</b>
