     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · Times of India · 2026-10-22 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>ICAI CA Inter September 2026 results declared, pass rates available</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Results</span> <span>#ICAI</span> <span>#CA Intermediate</span></div>
       <p>The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (ICAI) declared the CA Intermediate September 2026 examination results on October 22. Candidates who appeared for Group I, Group II, or both groups can check their scores and access the merit list through the official website, caresults.icai.org, using their six-digit roll number and registration number. The results portal also provides access to the Intermediate unit examination result.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-22/icai-ca-inter-september-2026-results-declared-pass-rates-ava.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>To view results, candidates must visit caresults.icai.org, select the Intermediate Examination result link for September 2026, enter their six-digit roll number and registration number, complete CAPTCHA verification, and submit details. The result can then be downloaded or printed for future reference. Candidates should review displayed details and retain a copy.</p><p>Official announcements from ICAI should be consulted for the September 2026 pass percentage and candidate totals. For comparison, the previous session in May 2026 recorded Group I pass rates of 10.25% (9,350 passed out of 91,237 appeared), Group II at 16.11% (10,372 passed out of 64,381 appeared), and both groups at 8.47% (2,820 passed out of 33,304 appeared). These figures are specific to May 2026.</p><p>Under examination criteria, candidates must secure at least 40% marks in each paper and 50% in aggregate in the relevant group to pass. Candidates who have passed should follow ICAI's instructions for the next stage of the Chartered Accountancy course. Those seeking verification of marks or certified copies should monitor official announcements for procedures, deadlines, and fees, as the September session's verification deadline has not been confirmed in the result portal information reviewed.</p><p>What to watch: ICAI announcements for September 2026 pass percentages and verification deadlines.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article is comprehensive and accurately reflects the provided source material, including specific statistics for the May 2026 session.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/education/news/icai-ca-inter-september-2026-result-declared-check-scorecard-link-pass-percentage-and-next-steps/articleshow/135107507.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-22/icai-ca-inter-september-2026-results-declared-pass-rates-ava" data-title="ICAI CA Inter September 2026 results declared, pass rates available"><b>Share:</b>
         <a class="sh-wa" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8 1.8A6.2 6.2 0 0 0 2.7 11L1.8 14.2l3.3-.9A6.2 6.2 0 1 0 8 1.8z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>WhatsApp</a> ·
         <a class="sh-tg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.4 1.6 1.6 7l3.6 1.2L6 13l2.2-3.1 3.4 2.4 2.8-10.7z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Telegram</a> ·
