         <a href="#" class="sh-save" data-id="/article/2026-10-22/icai-ca-inter-september-2026-results-declared-pass-rates-ava"><svg class="ic" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4.2 2.2h7.6v11.6L8 10.6l-3.8 3.2z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Save for later</a>
