      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/jain-college-to-host-iccmn-2026-in-belagavi-starting-today/article71612168.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
