     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-22 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Thiruvambady Devaswom Rejects Crime Branch Thrissur Pooram Report</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Thiruvambady Devaswom has formally rejected a Crime Branch investigation report regarding the 2024 Thrissur Pooram disruption. The report reportedly seeks permission to prosecute eight Devaswom office-bearers for conspiracy and incitement to riot, which secretary K. Girish Kumar claims unfairly shifts blame onto the organization.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-22/thiruvambady-devaswom-rejects-crime-branch-thrissur-pooram-r.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Devaswom officials allege significant police lapses during the festival and intend to meet with government ministers to demand an impartial reinvestigation. The current findings have faced criticism for failing to address the alleged role of former ADGP M.R. Ajith Kumar, who was previously implicated in the controversy by opposition parties.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief concisely covers the Devaswom's rejection of the report and the underlying conflict regarding police and administrative culpability.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/thiruvambady-devaswom-rejects-crime-branch-report-on-thrissur-pooram-disruption/article71611614.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/thrissur/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Thrissur</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-22/thiruvambady-devaswom-rejects-crime-branch-thrissur-pooram-r" data-title="Thiruvambady Devaswom Rejects Crime Branch Thrissur Pooram Report"><b>Share:</b>
